AltoLeverage::constructor(address,address)
├── given owner is zero
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
└── given owner is nonzero
    ├── when swapper is a contract
    │   └── it should store the supplied swapper
    ├── when swapper is zero or an EOA
    │   └── it should accept and store it without interface validation
    ├── it should store owner and initialize pendingOwner to zero
    ├── it should leave markets unsupported including zero owner and deployer addresses
    └── it should emit only OwnershipTransferred from zero to owner with no SwapperUpdated or MarketUpdated event
